<section style="padding:5rem 0;">
  <div style="max-width:780px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem;">

    <!-- Eyebrow -->
    <p class="fade-in" style="font-family:'Jost',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c9a84c;margin:0 0 1.25rem;text-align:center;">
      The hook
    </p>

    <!-- H2 -->
    <h2 class="fade-in" style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,3rem);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#f0ebe0;margin:0 0 2rem;text-align:center;">
      Your friends believe you can <em style="color:#c9a84c;font-style:italic;">handle more.</em>
    </h2>

    <!-- Body -->
    <div class="fade-in" style="font-family:'Jost',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:300;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75;color:#a39e92;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 2.5rem;">
      <p style="margin:0 0 1.25em;">
        Every morning you draw five cards at random from five categories: Physical, Mental, Nutrition, Recovery, and Wildcard. You look at the hand, decide what you can handle, and commit.
      </p>
      <p style="margin:0 0 1.25em;">
        Once you commit, those cards are locked. No one can touch them while you work or after you finish. Your cards are yours.
      </p>
      <p style="margin:0 0 1.25em;">
        Tomorrow's draw is a different story. Your friends earn cards of their own by finishing their own habits, and they can spend one on you before you wake up. They might swap a harder card into your hand, lock in one commitment before you've seen the rest, or hide the whole draw so you choose blind. They might also leave you something better than what you would have drawn.
      </p>
      <p style="margin:0;">
        So some mornings you wake up to a card you never would have picked for yourself, and you do it anyway. That is the practice.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Pull-quote -->
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;">
      <blockquote
        class="fade-in"
        style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(1.4rem,3.5vw,1.8rem);line-height:1.4;color:#c9a84c;border-left:2px solid #c9a84c;padding-left:1.5rem;margin:0;max-width:500px;"
      >
        "Completed cards are immune. That's the deal."
      </blockquote>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
